{"en": "1047986189", "title": "COMMENT ACHEMINER LES ÉCHANTILLONS EN INTERNE", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "2a160646cce0", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "a02e80ef21d8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bb40d8926fe7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez les échantillons à acheminer en interne. Dans cet exemple, nous sélectionnons deux échantillons."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075821.png", "id": "e240131a-aaf3-4f52-b523-0856e85742c4", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "215e64c72c07", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "8d480a43da3a", "order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "5e28b2afe271"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7806562e41da"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Route to Internal Analysis", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075837.png", "id": "4c39d120-0dfc-4a14-a21f-d3f0facc0978", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "0df3f0e6cce7", "height": 232}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "fed51926a9d2", "order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7c775c768d69"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dff2edea7a0b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ajoutez les plaques de dosage dans lesquelles les échantillons seront placés. Dans cet exemple, on clique sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Add 24- Well +  ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075855.png", "id": "4e20e71c-e081-42f1-9213-4fd42f58bace", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "67ad17cab477", "height": 234}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "c2f2987f059b", "order": 4}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6f8db8a34d9a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "493eae5e8648"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Route Samples ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Le puits est attribué automatiquement, ligne par ligne, selon la série de dénomination mise en évidence."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075914.png", "id": "f6d498a9-c064-4a14-b5d2-29dce08048c6", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "dfdbe8f3b603", "height": 231}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "f9e032b2be1b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d9cb118ecdd6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Après un clic sur le bouton Route Samples, les trois échantillons sont acheminés vers l'analyse interne. Remarque : ce sont les plaques à placer sur l'analyseur."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075933.png", "id": "29fe4e3f-ffbc-4a9e-9b2f-cd2bf6f06062", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "8854a599449d", "height": 233}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ebdd47d52d58"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Faites défiler jusqu'en bas de la page pour voir les échantillons acheminés. Les échantillons sont répartis sur les plaques : A3, A1 et A2."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 850, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 429, "alt": "image-20260202-075952.png", "id": "5589453d-f27e-489e-b221-eeeb235b9c41", "collection": "contentId-1047986189", "type": "file", "localId": "4444403e62ec", "height": 192}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "88f3abb02c18"}}], "version": 1}}